# NEEDS_REVIEW — {{REPO_NAME}}

Multi-agent consensus dissents land here. Append, do not overwrite. Operator ratifies; agents never silently close.

Routing rule (from global `AGENTS.MD` / `CONSTITUTION.md`):

- Runtime / auth / state mutation, push to `main`, PR merge, or secret exposure requires a second opinion.
- Constitutional dissent (`CONSTITUTION.md` rules) halts the change until the operator ratifies.
- Non-constitutional dissent is logged here as signal; the change may still proceed if the operator overrides explicitly in the same entry.

## Entry format

```
## {{DATE}} — <one-line summary>

- Change: <what was proposed>
- Source: <file paths, PR / commit ref>
- Reviewers: <agent A verdict>, <agent B verdict>
- Constitutional? yes | no
- Operator decision: pending | approved | rejected | deferred
- Notes: <free text>
```

